{"storyMeta":{"storyReviewType":"NONE","storyId":"main_15_level_main_15-15_end_variation02","storyGroup":"main_15","storySort":231,"storyDependence":"main_15_level_main_15-15_end_variation02","storyCanShow":0,"storyCode":"15-17","storyName":"“她”","storyPic":null,"storyInfo":"在对抗普瑞赛斯的过程中，博士、凯尔希和阿米娅竭尽全力。","storyCanEnter":1,"storyTxt":"obt/main/level_main_15-15_end_variation02","avgTag":"幕间","unLockType":"STAGE_CLEAR","costItemType":"NONE","costItemId":null,"costItemCount":0,"stageCount":1,"requiredStages":[{"stageId":"main_15-15","minState":"PLAYED","maxState":"COMPLETE"}],"prev":19,"next":21,"characters":["预言家","AMa-10","Mon3tr","普瑞赛斯","凯尔希","阿米娅","Mechanist","Logos","煌","Raidian","阿斯卡纶","？？？"]},"lines":[{"type":"header","key":"title_test","skippable":"true","mode":"BLACK_MASK","id":0},{"type":"stopmusic","id":1},{"type":"dialog","id":2},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":3},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":4},{"type":"charslot","id":5},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/a7/Avg_bg_bg_desert03_d.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":6},{"type":"bgeffect","name":"$eb_sand02","flip":"1","layer":"1","id":7},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_sandwnd","volume":"0","loop":"true","channel":"sand","id":8},{"type":"soundvolume","volume":"1","channel":"sand","fadetime":"2","id":9},{"type":"cameraeffect","effect":"Grayscale","amount":"0.8","keep":"true","id":10},{"type":"playmusic","intro":"$loneliness_intro","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/static/m_avg/m_avg_loneliness_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":11,"musicid":0},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"3","block":"true","id":12},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":13},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_fssand","id":14},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1360_1#1$1","duration":"1.5","isblock":"true","id":15},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":16},{"type":"dialogue","name":"预言家","text":"我们已经走出去很远了，恐怕再继续探索，也没有太大的意义了。","id":17,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/54/Avg_avg_npc_1360_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"预言家","text":"离我进入休眠已经过去了一万个自然日，泰拉的变化依然有限。","id":18,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/54/Avg_avg_npc_1360_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"预言家","text":"来自塔卫二的生命的火种还没有壮大。我往日的同伴，他们埋下的那几颗希望的种子，也迟迟没有发芽的迹象。","id":19,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/54/Avg_avg_npc_1360_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":20},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"n","id":21},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_mechafault","volume":"0.6","id":22},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":23},{"type":"dialogue","name":"AMa-10","text":"（表示沮丧的动作）","id":24},{"type":"dialog","id":25},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1360_1#1$1","id":26},{"type":"dialogue","name":"预言家","text":"失望吗？不......对这个结果，我也早有预期就是了。","id":27,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/54/Avg_avg_npc_1360_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"预言家","text":"我错估了一切发展的进度，这是一个错误的时间，我所能做的事也十分有限。","id":28,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/54/Avg_avg_npc_1360_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"预言家","text":"时间......我需要更多的时间。","id":29,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/54/Avg_avg_npc_1360_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"预言家","text":"我不能继续浪费这具身体的寿命了，我必须要回那座石棺继续沉睡，等待更成熟的时机。","id":30,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/54/Avg_avg_npc_1360_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"预言家","text":"......我不得不承认，我违背了诺言，这的确是一种背叛。","id":31,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/54/Avg_avg_npc_1360_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"预言家","text":"只是因为我依然热爱着生命，我没有办法做出希望以外的选择。","id":32,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/54/Avg_avg_npc_1360_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"预言家","text":"但是恐怕，她已经预料到了我提前苏醒的举动。","id":33,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/54/Avg_avg_npc_1360_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"预言家","text":"我在我休眠的石棺中，发现了修改灰质销钉的程序。","id":34,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/54/Avg_avg_npc_1360_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"n","id":35},{"type":"dialogue","name":"AMa-10","text":"（表示疑问的动作）","id":36},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1360_1#1$1","id":37},{"type":"dialogue","name":"预言家","text":"那是诞生在失落时代的技术，用以坚定我们的思维还有信念，若非如此，许多人的意志恐怕不足以支撑过那段没有尽头的绝望。","id":38,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/54/Avg_avg_npc_1360_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"预言家","text":"我和她共同度过了那段时间......","id":39,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/54/Avg_avg_npc_1360_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"预言家","text":"毫无疑问，她是最了解我的人，也是最理解我的人。也正因如此，与她的分歧，是我最深的遗憾。","id":40,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/54/Avg_avg_npc_1360_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"预言家","text":"她预料到了我的举动，隐藏在石棺中的程序随着我的苏醒而启动。它会修改我的认知，还有“辩论”的目的......","id":41,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/54/Avg_avg_npc_1360_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"预言家","text":"而我必须回到那座唯一的石棺来延续我的生命，尽管那意味着......","id":42,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/54/Avg_avg_npc_1360_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"预言家","text":"......我的时间不多了。","id":43,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/54/Avg_avg_npc_1360_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"预言家","text":"AMa-10......","id":44,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/54/Avg_avg_npc_1360_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"预言家","text":"不，我不应该再这样称呼你了。","id":45,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/54/Avg_avg_npc_1360_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"预言家","text":"这是一个代号，一种机械造物的代号。我应该给你起一个真正的名字。","id":46,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/54/Avg_avg_npc_1360_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"预言家","text":"方解石......光线在晶体中折射出两种不同的偏振光，那是很美丽的现象，和你很像。","id":47,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/54/Avg_avg_npc_1360_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"预言家","text":"Calcite......Kal'tsit......就叫你凯尔希吧。你喜欢这个名字吗？","id":48,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/54/Avg_avg_npc_1360_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"n","id":49},{"type":"dialogue","name":"AMa-10","text":"（表示喜悦的动作）","id":50},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1360_1#1$1","id":51},{"type":"dialogue","name":"预言家","text":"还有一些我来不及做到的事，我希望，能由你代我去完成。","id":52,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/54/Avg_avg_npc_1360_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"预言家","text":"......","id":53,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/54/Avg_avg_npc_1360_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"预言家","text":"凯尔希，我希望你能去保护这片大地上的生命。","id":54,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/54/Avg_avg_npc_1360_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"预言家","text":"新生的文明总是脆弱，艰难的环境却绝不会因此多半分仁慈。","id":55,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/54/Avg_avg_npc_1360_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"预言家","text":"插手文明的发展是一种傲慢，但我们的机会已经不多了，我也不知道这是否是我们仅有的机会。","id":56,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/54/Avg_avg_npc_1360_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"预言家","text":"文明循环往复，总是不可避免地重复歧路。他们会陷入暴力的争斗，无法自证的思维陷阱，自我怀疑的绝路......","id":57,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/54/Avg_avg_npc_1360_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"预言家","text":"这些事情都没有办法避免，但只是一点微小的偏差就足以让一个文明万劫不复。文明存在本身就是一种奇迹......","id":58,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/54/Avg_avg_npc_1360_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"预言家","text":"所以凯尔希，我希望你可以去指引他们。","id":59,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/54/Avg_avg_npc_1360_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"预言家","text":"双生循环的结构可以让你拥有近乎无限的生命，你可以陪伴拙稚的文明发展，你可以运用你的知识，去引导他们走上可以前行的道路。","id":60,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/54/Avg_avg_npc_1360_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"预言家","text":"这是一项艰难的使命，但是你或许可以做到，你应该——","id":61,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/54/Avg_avg_npc_1360_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"n","id":62},{"type":"text","text":"一阵沉默。","id":63},{"type":"text","text":"富于激情的演说戛然而止，预言家沉默地看了看眼前纤细精巧的机械生命，又看了看远处半隐藏在风沙中的群山。","id":64},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1360_1#1$1","id":65},{"type":"dialogue","name":"预言家","text":"......","id":66,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/54/Avg_avg_npc_1360_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"预言家","text":"不......","id":67,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/54/Avg_avg_npc_1360_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"预言家","text":"......忘了我刚才说的吧，凯尔希，忘了它们。","id":68,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/54/Avg_avg_npc_1360_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"预言家","text":"走吧。凯尔希。先去周围看看，再去远一些的山那头看看。去寻找生命的痕迹，去寻找存在的形式。","id":69,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/54/Avg_avg_npc_1360_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"预言家","text":"......我得回去了。等到你需要的时候，就唤醒我吧。","id":70,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/54/Avg_avg_npc_1360_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"预言家","text":"凯尔希，我希望你去做的事，或者说，我赋予你的使命，只有一个。","id":71,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/54/Avg_avg_npc_1360_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"预言家","text":"去找到你自己吧。","id":72,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/54/Avg_avg_npc_1360_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"预言家","text":"去寻找生命的痕迹，去寻找希望与未来。","id":73,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/54/Avg_avg_npc_1360_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"预言家","text":"凯尔希......自己去得出答案吧。","id":74,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/54/Avg_avg_npc_1360_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":75},{"type":"stopsound","channel":"sand","fadetime":"2","id":76},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"3","id":77},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":78},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"3","block":"true","id":79},{"type":"charslot","id":80},{"type":"bgeffect","id":81},{"type":"subtitle","text":"......凯尔希。","x":"300","y":"350","alignment":"center","size":"24","delay":"0.04","width":"700","id":82},{"type":"subtitle","text":"你已经寻找到自己生命的意义了吗？","x":"300","y":"350","alignment":"center","size":"24","delay":"0.04","width":"700","id":83},{"type":"subtitle","id":84},{"type":"cameraeffect","effect":"Grayscale","amount":"0","keep":"true","id":85},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/3e/Avg_bg_60_g13_rhodesdeck_origin.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":86},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":87},{"type":"playmusic","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/act37d0d0/m_bat_wdslm_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":88,"musicid":1},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":89},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":90},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"0.5","xstrength":"30","ystrength":"30","vibrato":"30","randomness":"90","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":91},{"type":"playsound","key":"$char_Mon3tr","id":92},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"npc_10002","id":93},{"type":"dialogue","name":"Mon3tr","text":"（兴奋的咆哮）","id":94,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/5c/Avg_npc_10002_1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1718_1#2$1","id":95},{"type":"dialogue","name":"普瑞赛斯","text":"......","id":96,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/52/Avg_avg_npc_1718_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":97},{"type":"charslot","id":98},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_scrystalroad","volume":"1","loop":"true","channel":"sc","id":99},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":100},{"type":"stopsound","channel":"sc","fadetime":"2","id":101},{"type":"text","text":"Mon3tr出现在你的身前，它的姿态却稍不同于往常。","id":102},{"type":"dialog","id":103},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"1","xstrength":"30","ystrength":"30","vibrato":"30","randomness":"90","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":104},{"type":"playsound","key":"$char_Mon3tr","id":105},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":106},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_rockbreakout","volume":"1","id":107},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":108},{"type":"text","text":"不用凯尔希的命令，它以迅猛的速度向敌人飞去，可一簇源石结晶拔地而起，将黑色的怪物完全包裹其中。","id":109},{"type":"dialog","id":110},{"type":"decision","options":{"1":{"id":"112","text":"凯尔希！当心——"}},"values":[],"id":111},{"type":"predicate","references":["1"],"id":112,"end":118},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1718_1#1$1","id":113},{"type":"dialogue","name":"普瑞赛斯","text":"你很让我惊喜，AMa-10。","id":114,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/b2/Avg_avg_npc_1718_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"普瑞赛斯","text":"你以切断自己双生循环的系统为代价来脱离我的控制，哪怕这样会使你的生命变得脆弱不堪。","id":115,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/b2/Avg_avg_npc_1718_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"普瑞赛斯","text":"不过，你真的打算用这样的方式杀了我吗？","id":116,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/b2/Avg_avg_npc_1718_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_003_kalts_1#6$1","id":117},{"type":"dialogue","name":"凯尔希","text":"我知道，在很久之前，你的意识已经与源石中的信息海洋同化。","id":118,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/6c/Avg_avg_003_kalts_1-6$1.png","end":true},{"type":"dialog","id":119},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_humanchange","volume":"1","id":120},{"type":"delay","time":"0.4","id":121},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":122},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0.5","block":"true","id":123},{"type":"background","id":124},{"type":"charslot","id":125},{"type":"cameraeffect","effect":"Grayscale","amount":"0.8","keep":"true","id":126},{"type":"image","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/41/Avg_50_i16.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":127},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0.5","block":"true","id":128},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":129},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":130},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0.5","block":"true","id":131},{"type":"image","id":132},{"type":"cameraeffect","effect":"Grayscale","amount":"0","keep":"true","id":133},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/3e/Avg_bg_60_g13_rhodesdeck_origin.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":134},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_003_kalts_1#6$1","id":135},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0.5","block":"true","id":136},{"type":"dialogue","name":"凯尔希","text":"在这种情况下，真正杀死你已经是不可能的事。","id":137,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/6c/Avg_avg_003_kalts_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"凯尔希","text":"但是特蕾西娅和特雷西斯做到的事，让我确信了一点。","id":138,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/6c/Avg_avg_003_kalts_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"凯尔希","text":"你对源石的控制并非无可动摇，依然存在一些手段来限制你对于源石的权限。","id":139,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/6c/Avg_avg_003_kalts_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1718_1#1$1","id":140},{"type":"dialogue","name":"普瑞赛斯","text":"你所说的两个人，我的确在源石内部见过他们。","id":141,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/b2/Avg_avg_npc_1718_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"普瑞赛斯","text":"他们的努力的确出人意料，是令人惊喜的挣扎。","id":142,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/b2/Avg_avg_npc_1718_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1718_1#10$1","id":143},{"type":"dialogue","name":"普瑞赛斯","text":"所以呢？你又如何确信，在这里杀了我不是徒劳之举？","id":144,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/50/Avg_avg_npc_1718_1-10$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_003_kalts_1#1$1","id":145},{"type":"dialogue","name":"凯尔希","text":"Mon3tr攻击你的时候，你选择了防御。","id":146,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/ae/Avg_avg_003_kalts_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1718_1#2$1","id":147},{"type":"dialogue","name":"普瑞赛斯","text":"......","id":148,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/52/Avg_avg_npc_1718_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"普瑞赛斯","text":"......你怎么能做到？","id":149,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/52/Avg_avg_npc_1718_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_003_kalts_1#11$1","id":150},{"type":"dialogue","name":"凯尔希","text":"看来你已经察觉到了。","id":151,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/e8/Avg_avg_003_kalts_1-11$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"凯尔希","text":"基于特蕾西娅对源石的研究，同样是模仿你对Dr.{@nickname}设下的陷阱，我对你所处的唤醒室加入了一些设计。","id":152,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/e8/Avg_avg_003_kalts_1-11$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"凯尔希","text":"只要你在这里醒来，你的意识，同样会困于这具身体，而无法重新回到源石内部的信息海洋。","id":153,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/e8/Avg_avg_003_kalts_1-11$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1718_1#3$1","id":154},{"type":"dialogue","name":"普瑞赛斯","text":"......？","id":155,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/9e/Avg_avg_npc_1718_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_003_kalts_1#6$1","id":156},{"type":"dialogue","name":"凯尔希","text":"或许你迟早能突破这一层限制，而且你依然有操作源石的权限，但此刻的你，也只是一个人类。","id":157,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/6c/Avg_avg_003_kalts_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1718_1#7$1","id":158},{"type":"dialogue","name":"普瑞赛斯","text":"你为了反抗我，竟然会做到这一步——","id":159,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/0e/Avg_avg_npc_1718_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_003_kalts_1#6$1","id":160},{"type":"dialogue","name":"凯尔希","text":"普瑞赛斯，你不是泰拉的造物主。这片大地上的一切生命，没有义务顺应你的意愿。","id":161,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/6c/Avg_avg_003_kalts_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_003_kalts_1#7$1","id":162},{"type":"dialogue","name":"凯尔希","text":"......这是我对你的报复，也是最后的反抗。","id":163,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/45/Avg_avg_003_kalts_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","id":164},{"type":"text","text":"你看到站在对面的女性脸上露出了一丝犹疑，但紧接着，源石开始在她的身旁环绕。","id":165},{"type":"dialog","id":166},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"1","xstrength":"10","ystrength":"10","vibrato":"90","randomness":"90","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":167},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_icecrystlncrse","volume":"1","id":168},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":169},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_003_kalts_1#6$1","id":170},{"type":"dialogue","name":"凯尔希","text":"......太迟了。","id":171,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/6c/Avg_avg_003_kalts_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":172},{"type":"charslot","id":173},{"type":"decision","options":{"1":{"id":"175","text":"阿米娅！帮助凯尔希！"}},"values":[],"id":174},{"type":"predicate","references":["1"],"id":175,"end":202},{"type":"effect","name":"$e_amiya_atk_01","layer":"1","id":176},{"type":"playsound","key":"$p_skill_chimera","volume":"1","id":177},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":178},{"type":"blocker","a":"0.8","r":"1","g":"1","b":"1","fadetime":"0.1","block":"true","id":179},{"type":"blocker","a":"0.8","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0.1","block":"true","id":180},{"type":"blocker","a":"0.8","r":"1","g":"1","b":"1","fadetime":"0.1","block":"true","id":181},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0.4","block":"true","id":182},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":183},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_phntsmbrek","volume":"1","id":184},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_phntsmglsbrek","volume":"1","id":185},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"0.8","xstrength":"50","ystrength":"50","vibrato":"90","randomness":"90","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":186},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"255","g":"255","b":"255","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":187},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"255","g":"255","b":"255","fadetime":"0.03","block":"true","id":188},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"255","g":"255","b":"255","fadetime":"0.5","block":"true","id":189},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":190},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"0.5","xstrength":"30","ystrength":"30","vibrato":"30","randomness":"90","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":191},{"type":"playsound","key":"$char_Mon3tr","id":192},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"npc_10002","id":193},{"type":"dialogue","name":"Mon3tr","text":"（激昂的咆哮）","id":194,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/5c/Avg_npc_10002_1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1037_amiya3_1#6$3","id":195},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿米娅","text":"凯尔希医生......这一次换我来保护您......","id":196,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/a6/Avg_avg_1037_amiya3_1-6$3.png"},{"type":"charslot","id":197},{"type":"text","text":"黑色的法术乱流击碎了源石晶簇，Mon3tr挣脱而出，继续向唯一的目标袭去。","id":198},{"type":"text","text":"源石晶簇重新开始聚集，却已经来不及构成足以抵挡Mon3tr爪锋的屏障。","id":199},{"type":"text","text":"你看到了普瑞赛斯紧张的神情，造物主面对她的造物流露出了恐惧。","id":200},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1718_1#7$1","id":201},{"type":"dialogue","name":"普瑞赛斯","text":"......！","id":202,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/0e/Avg_avg_npc_1718_1-7$1.png","end":true},{"type":"dialog","id":203},{"type":"charslot","id":204},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_gen_surfacefrozen","volume":"1","loop":"true","channel":"sur","id":205},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":206},{"type":"stopsound","channel":"sur","fadetime":"6","id":207},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_drkcludsthdr","volume":"0","loop":"true","channel":"d","id":208},{"type":"soundvolume","volume":"1","channel":"d","fadetime":"2","id":209},{"type":"text","text":"似乎是普瑞赛斯终于认同了她此时面临着威胁，整片甲板上的源石都开始回应她的意识而急剧滋长。","id":210},{"type":"text","text":"Mon3tr已经逼近了它的猎物。","id":211},{"type":"dialog","id":212},{"type":"stopsound","channel":"d","fadetime":"2","id":213},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":214},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":215},{"type":"charslot","id":216},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/22/Avg_bg_60_g15_rhodesabyss_off.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":217},{"type":"playsound","key":"$swordtsing4","id":218},{"type":"effect","name":"$e_slash_01_l","x":"68.2","y":"13.3","rox":"73.1","roy":"5.6","roz":"-75.4","layer":"1","id":219},{"type":"delay","time":"0.8","id":220},{"type":"playsound","key":"$swordtsing5","id":221},{"type":"effect","name":"$e_slash_01_l","x":"-86.9","y":"-27.5","rox":"-74.9","roy":"-15.2","roz":"118.3","layer":"2","id":222},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":223},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0.5","block":"true","id":224},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_521_1#1$1","id":225},{"type":"dialogue","name":"Mechanist","text":"右侧五名，确认瘫痪。","id":226,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/db/Avg_avg_npc_521_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4133_logos_1#1$1","id":227},{"type":"dialogue","name":"Logos","text":"“殁亡”。","id":228,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/45/Avg_avg_4133_logos_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":229},{"type":"charslot","id":230},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_boneflute_low","volume":"1","id":231},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":232},{"type":"blocker","a":"0.5","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1.5","block":"true","id":233},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":234},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_017_huang_1#4$2","id":235},{"type":"dialogue","name":"煌","text":"看上去神神道道的，结果不还是把那些我们已经打败过一次的敌人再拉出来一遍嘛，没什么大不了的。","id":236,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c0/Avg_avg_017_huang_1-4$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_017_huang_1#5$2","id":237},{"type":"dialogue","name":"煌","text":"再吃我这招——","id":238,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/0e/Avg_avg_017_huang_1-5$2.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":239},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_clothmovement","id":240},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","posfrom":"0,0","posto":"-200,40","afrom":"1","ato":"0","duration":"0.3","id":241},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":242},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0.5","block":"true","id":243},{"type":"charslot","id":244},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0.5","block":"true","id":245},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1727_1#1$1","id":246},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_1728_1#1$1","id":247},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":248},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"255","g":"255","b":"255","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":249},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"1","xstrength":"40","ystrength":"40","vibrato":"30","randomness":"90","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":250},{"type":"playsound","key":"$e_atk_saw_n_2","volume":"1","id":251},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"255","g":"255","b":"255","fadetime":"0.03","block":"true","id":252},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"255","g":"255","b":"255","fadetime":"0.5","block":"true","id":253},{"type":"playsound","key":"$e_atk_saw_n_1","volume":"1","id":254},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"1","xstrength":"40","ystrength":"40","vibrato":"30","randomness":"90","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":255},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_gen_explo_n","id":256},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":257},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0.05","block":"true","id":258},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0.05","block":"true","id":259},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0.05","block":"true","id":260},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":261},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_shdwblwvr","volume":"1","id":262},{"type":"charslot","duration":"1.5","isblock":"true","id":263},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":264},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_017_huang_1#4$2","id":265},{"type":"dialogue","name":"煌","text":"是我的错觉吗？这里原地产生敌人的速度好像变慢了？","id":266,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c0/Avg_avg_017_huang_1-4$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1730_1#3$1","id":267},{"type":"dialogue","name":"Raidian","text":"这里是PRTS的核心系统，从一开始，它就是在读取我们以往面对过的敌人的数据并复制出来。","id":268,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/12/Avg_avg_npc_1730_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"Raidian","text":"但是现在它读取资料库数据的速度变慢了，似乎是受到了一些阻碍......","id":269,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/12/Avg_avg_npc_1730_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"Raidian","text":"看来是博士那边的行动奏效了。","id":270,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/12/Avg_avg_npc_1730_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4132_ascln_1#4$1","id":271},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿斯卡纶","text":"抓紧这个机会，一举攻破它。","id":272,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/3e/Avg_avg_4132_ascln_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿斯卡纶","text":"我们要到Abyss深处去......还有人在等着我们。","id":273,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/3e/Avg_avg_4132_ascln_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":274},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"3","id":275},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":276},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":277},{"type":"charslot","id":278},{"type":"background","id":279},{"type":"dialogue","name":"凯尔希","text":"Mon3tr，熔毁。","id":280},{"type":"dialog","id":281},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0.1","block":"true","id":282},{"type":"playsound","key":"$p_skill_chimera","volume":"1","id":283},{"type":"delay","time":"0.3","id":284},{"type":"playsound","key":"$b_char_fireharm","volume":"1","id":285},{"type":"delay","time":"0.3","id":286},{"type":"playsound","key":"$b_char_fireharm","volume":"1","id":287},{"type":"delay","time":"0.3","id":288},{"type":"playsound","key":"$b_char_fireharm","volume":"1","id":289},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_gen_explo_n","id":290},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"255","g":"255","b":"255","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":291},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"255","g":"255","b":"255","fadetime":"0.05","block":"true","id":292},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"255","g":"255","b":"255","fadetime":"0.05","block":"true","id":293},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"255","g":"255","b":"255","fadetime":"0.05","block":"true","id":294},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"255","g":"255","b":"255","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":295},{"type":"text","text":"黑色的法术和激光轮番射向前方庞杂的源石晶簇，这样猛烈的攻势甚至压制住了源石扩张的态势。","id":296},{"type":"text","text":"直到法术的光芒淹没了普瑞赛斯的身形。","id":297},{"type":"dialog","id":298},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"false","id":299},{"type":"effect","name":"$e_sand_transition","layer":"3","id":300},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_sand_lp","volume":"1","loop":"true","channel":"sa","id":301},{"type":"delay","time":"3","id":302},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/3e/Avg_bg_60_g13_rhodesdeck_origin.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":303},{"type":"stopsound","channel":"sa","fadetime":"2","id":304},{"type":"delay","time":"3","id":305},{"type":"text","text":"烟尘散去后，只剩下一地的源石碎屑。","id":306},{"type":"text","text":"还有一件残破的白色外套。","id":307},{"type":"dialog","id":308},{"type":"decision","options":{"1":{"id":"310","text":"我们......打败她了吗？"}},"values":[],"id":309},{"type":"predicate","references":["1"],"id":310,"end":320},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_003_kalts_1#3$1","id":311},{"type":"dialogue","name":"凯尔希","text":"......","id":312,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/e6/Avg_avg_003_kalts_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1037_amiya3_1#1$3","id":313},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿米娅","text":"我感受不到......任何生命的迹象，感受不到任何情绪......","id":314,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/cb/Avg_avg_1037_amiya3_1-1$3.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿米娅","text":"或许......","id":315,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/cb/Avg_avg_1037_amiya3_1-1$3.png"},{"type":"charslot","id":316},{"type":"text","text":"情况发生得太突然，你对眼前的一系列变故都还没来得及有些实感。","id":317},{"type":"text","text":"你亲眼目睹了那个极具威胁的敌人在你面前灰飞烟灭。","id":318},{"type":"text","text":"可你没有任何松了一口气的感觉。","id":319},{"type":"dialogue","name":"？？？","text":"玩闹可以到此为止吗？","id":320,"end":true},{"type":"dialog","id":321},{"type":"playmusic","intro":"$m_act1mainss_bat1_intro","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/act1mainss/m_act1mainss_bat1_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":322,"musicid":2},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_drkcludsthdr","volume":"0","loop":"true","channel":"d","id":323},{"type":"soundvolume","volume":"1","channel":"d","fadetime":"2","id":324},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_gen_walk_n","id":325},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1718_1#1$1","duration":"1.5","isblock":"true","id":326},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":327},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"n","id":328},{"type":"decision","options":{"1":{"id":"330","text":"怎么回事......！"}},"values":[],"id":329},{"type":"predicate","references":["1"],"id":330,"end":347},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1037_amiya3_1#5$3","id":331},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿米娅","text":"这怎么会——","id":332,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/e0/Avg_avg_1037_amiya3_1-5$3.png"},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"0.3","xstrength":"30","ystrength":"30","vibrato":"30","randomness":"90","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":333},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_003_kalts_1#7$1","id":334},{"type":"dialogue","name":"凯尔希","text":"博士、阿米娅，后退！","id":335,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/45/Avg_avg_003_kalts_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1718_1#1$1","id":336},{"type":"dialogue","name":"普瑞赛斯","text":"有力的反抗，AMa-10，你的计划奏效了。","id":337,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/b2/Avg_avg_npc_1718_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"普瑞赛斯","text":"诚如你所说，现在你们的确有杀死我的机会......","id":338,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/b2/Avg_avg_npc_1718_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1718_1#10$1","id":339},{"type":"dialogue","name":"普瑞赛斯","text":"可是，只是一个用源石塑造出的替身，就会让你如此慌张吗？","id":340,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/50/Avg_avg_npc_1718_1-10$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_003_kalts_1#6$1","id":341},{"type":"dialogue","name":"凯尔希","text":"......！","id":342,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/6c/Avg_avg_003_kalts_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1718_1#10$1","id":343},{"type":"dialogue","name":"普瑞赛斯","text":"AMa-10，我无意与你辩论你信奉的价值。","id":344,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/50/Avg_avg_npc_1718_1-10$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"普瑞赛斯","text":"你一直以来所坚持的事，它们太渺小，我甚至无法找到一种可信的逻辑架构来评价它们的意义。","id":345,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/50/Avg_avg_npc_1718_1-10$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"普瑞赛斯","text":"可是实验中的确会出现这样的情况，一些细小的误差，最终造成了巨大的妨碍。我不得不接受这样的结果。","id":346,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/50/Avg_avg_npc_1718_1-10$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"普瑞赛斯","text":"我很遗憾，要将你当作这个误差来抹除。","id":347,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/50/Avg_avg_npc_1718_1-10$1.png","end":true},{"type":"dialog","id":348},{"type":"charslot","id":349},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_crystalrise","volume":"1","id":350},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_erthshkng","volume":"0.4","loop":"true","channel":"e","id":351},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"4","xstrength":"10","ystrength":"10","vibrato":"90","randomness":"90","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":352},{"type":"stopsound","channel":"e","fadetime":"6","id":353},{"type":"delay","time":"4","id":354},{"type":"text","text":"普瑞赛斯抬起了手。","id":355},{"type":"text","text":"源石再次开始生长，结晶构成的尖锐的枝桠在你与阿米娅的身边密集地围绕起来，顷刻间便要将你们吞没。","id":356},{"type":"text","text":"阿米娅拼尽全力用法术击碎周遭的源石，可晶簇生长的速度远为迅捷。","id":357},{"type":"dialog","id":358},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1037_amiya3_1#4$3","id":359},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿米娅","text":"博士！躲在我身后——","id":360,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/e1/Avg_avg_1037_amiya3_1-4$3.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_003_kalts_1#4$1","id":361},{"type":"dialogue","name":"凯尔希","text":"——！","id":362,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/10/Avg_avg_003_kalts_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"0.3","xstrength":"30","ystrength":"30","vibrato":"30","randomness":"90","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":363},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_003_kalts_1#7$1","id":364},{"type":"dialogue","name":"凯尔希","text":"Mon3tr——","id":365,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/45/Avg_avg_003_kalts_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":366},{"type":"charslot","id":367},{"type":"effect","name":"$e_amiya_atk_01","layer":"1","id":368},{"type":"playsound","key":"$p_skill_chimera","volume":"1","id":369},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":370},{"type":"blocker","a":"0.8","r":"1","g":"1","b":"1","fadetime":"0.1","block":"true","id":371},{"type":"blocker","a":"0.8","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0.1","block":"true","id":372},{"type":"blocker","a":"0.8","r":"1","g":"1","b":"1","fadetime":"0.1","block":"true","id":373},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0.4","block":"true","id":374},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":375},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"1","xstrength":"40","ystrength":"40","vibrato":"30","randomness":"90","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":376},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_gen_explo_n","id":377},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"255","g":"255","b":"255","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":378},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"255","g":"255","b":"255","fadetime":"0.05","block":"true","id":379},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"255","g":"255","b":"255","fadetime":"0.05","block":"true","id":380},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"255","g":"255","b":"255","fadetime":"0.05","block":"true","id":381},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"255","g":"255","b":"255","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":382},{"type":"text","text":"这一切都在电光石火间发生。","id":383},{"type":"text","text":"你看到源石晶簇在与你近在咫尺的地方炸裂，阿米娅想要保护你，可时间不允许她作出任何反应。","id":384},{"type":"text","text":"你看到黑色怪物在这一瞬间来到了你和阿米娅的身边，用庞大且坚实的身躯挡在了你们与源石晶簇之间。","id":385},{"type":"text","text":"你看到了凯尔希......","id":386},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1718_1#8$1","id":387},{"type":"dialogue","name":"普瑞赛斯","text":"可惜。","id":388,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f7/Avg_avg_npc_1718_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":389},{"type":"stopsound","channel":"d","fadetime":"1","id":390},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"1","id":391},{"type":"charslot","duration":"1.5","id":392},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"6","xstrength":"5","ystrength":"5","vibrato":"90","randomness":"90","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":393},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_scrystalroad","volume":"1","loop":"true","channel":"sc","id":394},{"type":"delay","time":"3","id":395},{"type":"stopsound","channel":"sc","fadetime":"0.5","id":396},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_phntsmbrek","volume":"1","id":397},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_phntsmglsbrek","volume":"1","id":398},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"255","g":"255","b":"255","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":399},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"255","g":"255","b":"255","fadetime":"0.1","block":"true","id":400},{"type":"background","id":401},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"255","g":"255","b":"255","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":402},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":403},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":404},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":405},{"type":"background","id":406},{"type":"cameraeffect","effect":"Grayscale","amount":"0.8","keep":"true","id":407},{"type":"image","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/37/Avg_avg_ac8mi_melancholic_kalts.png","screenadapt":"coverall","xScale":"1.1","yScale":"1.1","id":408},{"type":"imagetween","xFrom":"50","xTo":"-50","duration":"20","block":"false","id":409},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_snowstormflp","volume":"0","loop":"true","channel":"sn","id":410},{"type":"soundvolume","volume":"1","channel":"sn","fadetime":"2","id":411},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":412},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"4","block":"false","id":413},{"type":"text","text":"你会质疑自己存在的意义吗，博士？我会。","id":414},{"type":"text","text":"我很清楚自己的使命，尽管艰难，但我认同它的意义。","id":415},{"type":"text","text":"关于未来，你会有自己的答案，我只能这样坚持。","id":416},{"type":"text","text":"不用太担心我的事情，罗德岛不应当脆弱到离开了某人就无法前行。","id":417},{"type":"dialog","id":418},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":419},{"type":"text","text":"我的愿望？","id":420},{"type":"text","text":"我的愿望就是守护好你和阿米娅的愿望。","id":421},{"type":"text","text":"我立下的誓言我永远不会背弃。尽管我们对守护的定义各不相同，但我会站在这里，直到最后。","id":422},{"type":"text","text":"我们无法忘怀过去，但你会有不一样的未来。","id":423},{"type":"dialog","id":424},{"type":"image","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/ae/Avg_avg_ac8mi_sidebyside_dusk.png","screenadapt":"coverall","fadetime":"2","id":425},{"type":"imagetween","xScaleFrom":"1.05","yScaleFrom":"1.05","xScaleTo":"1","yScaleTo":"1","duration":"10","block":"false","id":426},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":427},{"type":"text","text":"我已经寻找到了自己生命的意义。","id":428},{"type":"text","text":"请带领罗德岛......","id":429},{"type":"text","text":"继续走下去吧。","id":430},{"type":"text","text":"{@nickname}。","id":431},{"type":"dialog","id":432},{"type":"stopsound","channel":"sn","fadetime":"2","id":433},{"type":"musicvolume","volume":"0.2","fadetime":"3","id":434},{"type":"playmusic","intro":"$m_sys_act1mainss_intro","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/act1mainss/m_sys_act1mainss_loop.mp3","volume":"0","id":435,"musicid":3},{"type":"musicvolume","volume":"0.6","fadetime":"4","id":436},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"3","block":"true","id":437},{"type":"image","id":438},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":439},{"type":"subtitle","text":"不知不觉，我好像已经习惯了有人在我身边来帮助我、引导我。","x":"300","y":"350","alignment":"center","size":"24","delay":"0.04","width":"700","id":440},{"type":"subtitle","text":"直到现在，我终于可以确定自己要做的事情。","x":"300","y":"350","alignment":"center","size":"24","delay":"0.04","width":"700","id":441},{"type":"subtitle","text":"无论怎样，这条路我会继续走下去。我不会放弃希望。","x":"300","y":"350","alignment":"center","size":"24","delay":"0.04","width":"700","id":442},{"type":"subtitle","text":"可是......","x":"300","y":"350","alignment":"center","size":"24","delay":"0.04","width":"700","id":443},{"type":"subtitle","text":"......你呢？","x":"300","y":"350","alignment":"center","size":"24","delay":"0.04","width":"700","id":444},{"type":"subtitle","id":445},{"type":"musicvolume","volume":"0.6","fadetime":"2","id":446},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":447},{"type":"cameraeffect","effect":"Grayscale","amount":"0","keep":"true","id":448},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/3e/Avg_bg_60_g13_rhodesdeck_origin.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":449},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_humanchange","volume":"1","id":450},{"type":"delay","time":"0.4","id":451},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1037_amiya3_1#5$3","id":452},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0.5","block":"true","id":453},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿米娅","text":"凯尔希医生——！","id":454,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/e0/Avg_avg_1037_amiya3_1-5$3.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":455},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"n","id":456},{"type":"decision","options":{"1":{"id":"458","text":"......凯尔希......？"}},"values":[],"id":457},{"type":"predicate","references"